GQ","user":{"login":"mechalynx","id":8427257,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MjcyNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8427257?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx","html_url":"https://github.com/mechalynx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T18:43:52Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T18:43:52Z","body":"Tested from the artifacts. I think the changes are good but I would prefer if the option to include incompatible addons was more prominent (as in, right on the asset store UI) and that warning signs do appear in the results themselves on the addon if its latest version is the one that's incompatible. This is because I feel the option is a bit hard to discover, especially since it's an advanced option, which somewhat reduces its effectiveness from the perspective of related issues, and showing it in the result itself makes it clearer that those results were removed prior to allowing incompatible versions.\r\n\r\nI understand the intent here is specifically for addon authors and from that perspective it works fine. I'm commenting on the change from the perspective of the proposal since it touches on the same issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4673346073/reactions"